title: "NixOS-Dev-Quick-Deploy (AQ-OS): a local-first, multi-agent NixOS development harness"
abstract: >-
  A production-grade NixOS-first deployment harness and AQ-OS AI-native operating
  environment: a local-first, multi-agent, self-improving (Pessimistic Recursive
  Self-Improvement) factory with declarative gates, bound review, and activation-gated
  delivery.
